      "raw_description": "DATA ANALYST INTERN Company: Dexterz Technology Location: Remote (Work From Home) Duration: 3 Months Stipend: Up to ₹10,000 (Performance-Based) Internship Type: Remote Internship Eligibility: College Students Only Turn Data Into Insights. Start Your Analytics Career! Interested in Data Analytics, Excel, SQL, Power BI, or Python ? Looking to gain practical experience while pursuing your studies? Dexterz Technology is inviting enthusiastic college students to join its 3-month remote Data Analyst Internship Program. Develop practical skills in data cleaning, data visualization, dashboard creation, and business analytics through hands-on projects and analytical assignments. Freshers Welcome! No previous internship experience required. What You'll Work On Clean, organize, and analyze datasets using Excel or Google Sheets. Explore SQL for data extraction and analysis. Create interactive dashboards and visual reports using Power BI or Tableau. Explore Python, Pandas, and NumPy for data analysis. Identify trends, track KPIs, and generate meaningful business insights. Prepare analytical reports and complete data-focused projects. Who Can Apply? College students pursuing B.Tech, BCA, B.Sc., B.Com, BBA, MCA, or related degrees. Students interested in Data Analytics, Business Intelligence, and Data Visualization. Basic knowledge of Excel, Google Sheets, or analytical concepts. Familiarity with SQL, Power BI, or Python is an advantage, not mandatory . Students with analytical thinking, curiosity, and problem-solving skills. Why Join Dexterz Technology? 100% Remote: Gain practical experience from anywhere in India. Hands-On Projects: Apply your knowledge to data analysis assignments. Industry-Relevant Skills: Explore Excel, SQL, Power BI, Python, and analytical techniques. Practical Exposure: Develop data cleaning, reporting, and visualization skills. Career Development: Build a foundation for Data Analyst, Business Analyst, and Business Intelligence roles. Performance-Based Stipend: Opportunity to earn up to ₹10,000 based on performance. Your Data Analytics Career Starts Here! Whether you're starting with Excel or exploring Python and Power BI, this internship offers an opportunity to strengthen your analytical skills through practical experience. Apply Now and Take Your First Step Towards Becoming a Data Analyst with Dexterz Technology!",
