      "raw_description": "Data Analyst Company: JobSPhere Location: Remote Employment Type: Full-Time Compensation: Performance-Based, up to ₹40,000/- About the Company JobSPhere focuses on connecting talent with meaningful career opportunities while encouraging professional development and practical industry experience. We aim to create opportunities for individuals to enhance their skills and build successful careers. About the Role Are you passionate about numbers, data, and discovering insights? JobSPhere is looking for an enthusiastic Data Analyst Intern who can turn raw information into meaningful insights. This role offers an opportunity to work on practical assignments, understand business data, and develop analytical skills. Key Responsibilities 📈 Collect, organize, and interpret datasets. Clean and process raw data for analysis. Develop charts, dashboards, and visual reports. Identify trends, patterns, and performance indicators. Generate reports to support business strategies. Present findings and recommendations to the team. Maintain proper documentation of analytical work. Eligibility Students or graduates from Data Science, Statistics, Mathematics, Computer Science, or related backgrounds. Basic understanding of data analytics. Strong attention to detail and problem-solving abilities. Passion for learning and exploring data-driven technologies. Required Skills Excel or Google Sheets. Basic to intermediate SQL. Fundamentals of Python. Basic knowledge of Power BI or Tableau. Analytical thinking and communication skills. Perks & Benefits 💰 Performance-based compensation up to ₹40,000/-. Work on practical data analytics projects. Gain exposure to real-world business datasets. Improve technical and analytical skills. Opportunities for professional growth. Build a strong foundation for your data analytics career. Equal Opportunity JobSPhere welcomes candidates from diverse educational and professional backgrounds. We believe in creating an inclusive environment that supports learning, growth, and equal opportunities.",
