      "description": "Voy is UK, Germany, Brazil and India's leading healthtech company. We're hiring for full-time interns, in final semester of university across: Growth Marketing Intern Brand Marketing Intern UX-UI Design Intern Talent Acquisition Intern Operations Intern HR Intern Founder’s Office...",
      "raw_description": "Voy is UK, Germany, Brazil and India's leading healthtech company. We're hiring for full-time interns, in final semester of university across: Growth Marketing Intern Brand Marketing Intern UX-UI Design Intern Talent Acquisition Intern Operations Intern HR Intern Founder’s Office Intern Product Analyst Intern / APM Intern About Voy Voy is one of the fastest-growing global health-tech startups, serving over 2 million customers and redesigning healthcare from the ground up. We operate across weight loss, hair loss, dermatology, men’s and women’s health, and preventative health. We’re present in the UK, Germany and Brazil, and have recently expanded to India. About the space GLP-1s are a quantum leap in healthcare (think penicillin!) and possibly the biggest healthcare opportunity of our lifetimes. The GLP market went from 0 to $60B in 8 years and is estimated to reach $200B in the next 10. India is about 8 years behind the US and Europe, which means a rare chance to create a category in a white space (think Paytm for mobile wallets). The semaglutide patent expired in India in March 2026, bringing monthly medication prices from Rs 20k to Rs 3k. With 250 million obese Indians who can now afford life-changing care that never existed here before, you do the math. What you’ll do ? Take on a live problem in your function, from discovery to a small pilot to execution Work cross-functionally with product, clinical, operations and growth teams Use data and customer insight to back your decisions Build processes and SOPs that outlast your internship Present your work and recommendations directly to the team What we’re looking for ? Curiosity, ownership and a bias for action Strong communication and a willingness to learn quickly Comfort with ambiguity and fast-moving priorities A desire to come to Delhi and build from scratch Why intern with us? Career growth: 70% of our Jan 2026 interns converted to full-time roles Competitive stipend: a competitive monthly stipend Hands-on learning: practical experience in a fast-growing healthtech business Global exposure: work with a global company with teams across the UK, Germany and Brazil Ownership and impact: real responsibility from week one Who can apply? Undergraduate students currently in their final or pre-final semester Full-time conversion: Intern-to-full-time conversion is based on individual performance and is considered after submission of a provisional certificate or equivalent proof of graduation. Work location and schedule Location: Voy India, DLF Tower A, Jasola, New Delhi – 110025 Work mode: Work from office Working days: 6 days a week If this sounds like you, apply and let’s chat! Some reading before we meet? Voy India Website: joinvoy.in App: https://joinvoy.in/get-app Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/joinvoyindia/",
