      "raw_description": "BUSINESS ANALYTICS INTERN Company: Dexter's Tech Location: Remote Employment Type: Full-Time Compensation: Performance-Based, up to ₹25,000/- ABOUT THE COMPANY Dexter's Tech is a technology-driven organization focused on delivering business intelligence, data analytics, and strategic business solutions. The company leverages data-driven approaches to help businesses improve performance, optimize operations, and make informed decisions. ABOUT THE ROLE Dexter's Tech is seeking a skilled and detail-oriented Business Analyst to join its team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for analyzing business data, identifying trends, evaluating performance metrics, and providing actionable insights to support business growth and strategic decision-making. The role involves working with different business functions, preparing analytical reports, developing dashboards, conducting market research, and identifying opportunities for process improvement. KEY RESPONSIBILITIES Collect, organize, and analyze business data from multiple sources. Analyze business trends, patterns, and performance metrics. Monitor Key Performance Indicators (KPIs) and prepare regular reports. Create dashboards and data visualizations to present business insights. Analyze sales, customer, marketing, and operational performance. Conduct market research and competitor analysis. Identify business challenges and recommend effective solutions. Translate business requirements into actionable analytical insights. Prepare reports and presentations for management and stakeholders. Collaborate with cross-functional teams to improve business processes. ELIGIBILITY CRITERIA Bachelor's degree in Business Analytics, Business Administration, Data Science, Statistics, Economics, Computer Science, or a related field. Relevant academic or professional experience in business or data analysis is preferred. Strong understanding of business operations and analytical concepts. Ability to interpret data and convert findings into meaningful business recommendations. Ability to manage tasks independently and meet deadlines. REQUIRED SKILLS Strong analytical and problem-solving abilities. Proficiency in Microsoft Excel or Google Sheets. Basic to intermediate knowledge of SQL. Familiarity with Power BI, Tableau, or other data visualization tools. Understanding of KPI tracking, business reporting, and data interpretation. Good research, documentation, and presentation skills. Strong communication and interpersonal abilities. Attention to detail and a result-oriented approach. PERKS & BENEFITS Performance-based compensation of up to ₹25,000/-. Opportunity to work on real-world business projects. Exposure to business intelligence and data-driven decision-making. Professional growth and skill development opportunities. Collaborative and supportive work environment. Recognition for excellent performance and contributions. EQUAL OPPORTUNITY STATEMENT Dexter's Tech is an equal opportunity organization committed to maintaining an inclusive and supportive workplace. We welcome applications from qualified candidates regardless of their background and encourage individuals with strong analytical abilities and a passion for business growth to apply. Ready to turn data into impactful business decisions? Join Dexter's Tech and take the next step in your professional career!",
