      "raw_description": "DATA ANALYST INTERN Company: Devryxa Location: Remote Employment Type: Full-Time Compensation: Performance-Based, up to ₹35,000/- ABOUT THE COMPANY Devryxa focuses on delivering data-driven solutions that help businesses transform raw information into meaningful insights. The company emphasizes analytical thinking, technology, and data-backed strategies to support smarter business decisions and organizational growth. ABOUT THE ROLE Devryxa is seeking a detail-oriented and analytical Data Analyst to join its team. The selected candidate will work with datasets to identify trends, evaluate performance, and generate actionable insights. This role involves data processing, statistical analysis, dashboard development, and reporting to support business objectives. KEY RESPONSIBILITIES Collect, clean, process, and analyze data from multiple sources. Create and maintain dashboards, reports, and visualizations. Identify trends, patterns, and business performance indicators. Conduct exploratory data analysis to support decision-making. Ensure data accuracy, consistency, and reliability. Translate complex data into clear and actionable insights. Collaborate with teams to understand analytical requirements. Present findings and recommendations to relevant stakeholders. ELIGIBILITY CRITERIA Bachelor's degree or currently pursuing a degree in Data Science, Statistics, Mathematics, Computer Science, or a related field. Strong interest in data analytics and business intelligence. Good analytical, logical-thinking, and problem-solving abilities. Ability to interpret data and communicate insights effectively. REQUIRED SKILLS Proficiency in Microsoft Excel or Google Sheets. Basic to intermediate knowledge of SQL. Familiarity with Python for data analysis is preferred. Understanding of data cleaning, analysis, and visualization. Knowledge of Power BI or Tableau is an advantage. Strong attention to detail and organizational skills. Effective written and verbal communication. Ability to work independently and collaboratively in a remote environment. PERKS & BENEFITS Performance-based compensation up to ₹35,000/-. Opportunity to work on practical business analytics projects. Exposure to industry-relevant tools and technologies. Professional development and career growth opportunities. Collaborative and supportive work environment. Opportunity to contribute to data-driven business strategies. EQUAL OPPORTUNITY STATEMENT Devryxa is committed to building an inclusive and supportive workplace. We welcome applicants from diverse backgrounds who are passionate about data, problem-solving, and continuous professional growth. Ready to turn data into meaningful insights? Apply now and take the next step in your Data Analytics career with Devryxa!",
